          },
          "_name": "features017",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features017 mbr-embla\" group=\"Gallery & Slider\" plugins=\"embla\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Carousel</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"autoplay\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" title=\"Interval\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" step=\"1\" condition=\"autoplay\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Loop\" name=\"loop\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Draggable\" name=\"draggable\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrows\" title=\"Arrows\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrowsMobile\" title=\"Mobile Arrows\" condition=\"arrows\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"gap\" title=\"Gap\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax required>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"position-relative\">\n\t\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth,\n                    'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>2026信用卡回饋比較總覽&nbsp;</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t使用信用卡消費主要有4大類需求：\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n</div><div>一般消費：日常生活物品消費、飲食消費、娛樂活動\n</div><div>繳費：水、電、瓦斯、電話費、保費、學費\n</div><div>交通費：開車加油費、大眾交通工具費、停車費\n</div><div>信用卡優惠及權益：辦卡拿好禮、道路救援\n</div><div>每個類別都有各自推薦不錯的信用卡</div></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"embla\" data-loop=\"{{loop}}\" data-auto-play=\"{{autoplay}}\" data-auto-play-interval=\"{{interval}}\" data-draggable=\"{{draggable}}\" data-skip-snaps=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-contain-scroll=\"trimSnaps\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__viewport\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item active\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"slide-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/e89ea2e5b995e693b7e58f96e795abe99da2202026-11-1920171919-232x172.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>匯豐-</b><b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">御璽卡</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">回饋無上限，且權益少變動<br><b>現金回饋</b><br>• 國內 1.22%\n<br>• 國外 2.22%\n<br>無上限</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://card.apply.hsbc.com.tw/hsbcoa/credit_card/select_your_card?cardid=1&cid=HBTW:JC(T:A0:CC:00:2610:060:26Q4&BannerID=ISO-rich01-2026-Q4-02-Y&FromCard=1&CardType=VM\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">官網申辦</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"slide-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/j.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>富邦</b>-<b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">J Cash卡</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">日泰韓旅遊首選卡\n<br><b>現金回饋</b><br>• 日韓泰等亞洲9國 最高 6%\n<br>• 日本交通卡 最高 10%\n<br>• 指定飯店/訂房/機票最\n<br>高 18%</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://ebank.taipeifubon.com.tw/EXT/common/CAC/CACLineIndex.faces?fromSC_code=MD02&fromUrl=Fubon2026054\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">官網申辦</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"slide-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/14315-live-plus-visa-card-1200x387.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>滙豐</b>-<b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">Live+現金回饋卡</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">海外/線上網購高回饋<br><b>現金回饋</b><br>最高 4.88%</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://card.apply.hsbc.com.tw/hsbcoa/credit_card/select_your_card?cardid=15&cid=HBTW:JC(T:A0:CC:00:2610:062:26Q4&BannerID=ISO-rich01-2026-Q4-04-Y&FromCard=1&CardType=VK\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">官網申辦</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"slide-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kv-card-1200x929.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>王道</b>-<b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">O! Range卡</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">國內外網購皆有高回饋\n<br><b>現金回饋</b><br>• 網購+支付最高 23.68%\n<br>• 蝦皮/MOMO/酷澎最高  10.88%\n<br>• 海外網購最高 6%</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://www.o-bank.com/ebank/apps/services/www/ibmb/desktopbrowser/default/react-index.html\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">官網申辦</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"slide-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/cubekv-800x800-800x800.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"6\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>國泰世華</b>-<b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">CUBE信用卡</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t免費停車<br>配合多家市區停車場\n<br>每日1次3小時</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://www.cathaybk.com.tw/cathaybk/onlineservice/CreditCard/CreditCardApply/cardgrade-s2.aspx?CardMain=24&Cub_ProjectCode=DBB4100001&gad_source=1&gad_campaignid=22687071549&gbraid=0AAAAACsfCON9EmGAgybIQwqShJpAR3LrN&gclid=Cj0KCQiA2frXBhC_ARIsAPTFcdNjoruUcKtk6G5cFUQmtRxwlRTCjVVATqP9-RWMEhJE5KDGiWOKum0aAlhNEALw_wcB&_gl=1*1yx2kyf*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE3OTUwODA2MzUuQ2owS0NRaUEyZnJYQmhDX0FSSXNBUFRGY2ROam9ydVVjS3RrNkc1Y0ZVUW10Unh3bFJUQ2pWVkFUcVA5LVJXTUVoSkU1S0RHaVdPS3VtMGFBbGhORUFMd193Y0I.*_gcl_au*MTYxNzY0NDQ4MS4xNzk1MDgwNjM1*_ga*MTUzNzg3NjEwNi4xNzk1MDgwNjM1*_ga_T2T689XRGT*czE3OTUwODA2MzUkbzEkZzAkdDE3OTUwODA2MzUkajYwJGwwJGgw\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">官網申辦</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"slide-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img-cards-richart-card2x-740x641.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"7\" data-bs-slide-to=\"7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>台新</b>-<b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">Richart卡</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">三大影城\n<br>+指刷卡最高2%\n<br>6折起</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">官網申辦</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"slide-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop0.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"8\" data-bs-slide-to=\"8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>永豐</b>-<b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">大戶卡</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">國內：\n<br>• 基本1%無上限\n<br>• 大戶: 3.5%\n<br>• 大戶Plus: 5%\n<br>• 悠遊卡自動加值: 大戶3%/大戶Plus 5%\n<br>國外：\n<br>• 基本: 2%無上限\n<br>• 大戶: 4.5%\n<br>• 大戶Plus: 6%</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://applydawho.sinopac.com/OpenAccount/OpenAccount/Login?openExternalBrowser=1&tickset=SIN020&tko=26plusq3#\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">官網申辦</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<button class=\"embla__button embla__button--prev\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t<button class=\"embla__button embla__button--next\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vBppbOlage",
          "_anchor": "features017-1o",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".img-wrapper": {
              "width": "10rem",
              "padding-right": "2rem"
            },
            ".card-text": {
              "color": "#232323"
            }
